'''Call Center Cat''' (コールセンターのOL, ''Kōru Sentā no OL'', '''Call Center's Office Lady''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Vacation Awakes!]]. She was added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Call Center Cat
|image = E 253.png
|appearance = [[Vacation Awakes!]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, high attack power, and a chance to knockback Cats. She has a quick attack animation and attacks rapidly.

==Strategy==
Try and use high-damaging Cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] (Normal/Evolved) and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]], coupled with meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall/Manic Eraser Cat]]. Alone, she is pretty easy, but when there are multiple, a lot of meatshielding is needed. Like above, cats with a knockback ability help because they not only make them stay away from your cat stack, but also help by interrupting their long attack animation.

